   StatefulExecution over the 16-stage macro pipeline with per-stage
   SWARM cycle and defect-focus loop; --board is the combined
   parallel progress view closing G5.)
  (Phase 161 — RECONCILE is cycle step 1; InitialLoad adds
   dispatch-channels.sdd + subagent-lifecycle.sdd; [SWARM-08]
   binds pyramid rules [SW1-9]-[SW1-14] per DEC-2026-1011-002)
# Reading discipline (reference)
Follows CLAUDE.md Reading Strategy: goal-first, grep-before-read, ead(offset,limit) slices, Read Plan when >=2 files or >250 lines, stop at goal.
